{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"原片｜鄧炳強講打擊樓宇維修工程圍標聯合特遣隊第二輪行動\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-1730-LIVE-PC-261123.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】聯合特遣隊進行第二輪打擊樓宇維修工程圍標行動，並瓦解圍標集團，保安局局長鄧炳強指，次輪行動涉及15個屋苑或住宅大廈，工程合約總值1.3億元，拘捕33名承建商及業主立案法團相關人士，部分人有黑社會背景。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:43:56.806869+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:41.430004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T10:37:32.441233+00:00","content_hash":"0772902e79f7988b5ad31131e31f5b2ab1acb1b36320f0c85741bcefcd9fd823","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}